{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1bec52d4e8188cfcdfa8aa410846d0da75599da9f7be9b74155cff02985c4b6a", "ja": "（海美がイベントで足をくじいて、数日が経った。\n大きなケガにならなくて幸いだったけど……）", "zh": "（海美在活动中扭伤了脚，几天过去了。\n幸好没有造成严重的伤势，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1001_p", "source_sha256": "75d147b17fbbbb7332b4801cc4214abef94e65489122d8c4cd7129a0ec934df5", "ja": "海美。足の具合はどうだ？", "zh": "海美，你的脚现在感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "fae7d3d4b075ba54605373e5006246ad42b12d09ff0b0753f5170e386aa4de1c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさま～……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦啦～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "5e623350d644b3371b5aa6f4f73092f17533b002927e21bc2a0889201a94ce64", "ja": "足の具合は……うん、もう平気だよ。\n今日のレッスンから、出てもいいって言われたし。", "zh": "腿的情况……嗯，已经没事了哦。也有人说从今天的课程开始可以参加了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3db5493a3572844d7385774d695883dda18fed249b197adca70c346d14a0224c", "ja": "海美、なんだか元気がないな？\nもしかして、まだ痛むんじゃ……。", "zh": "海美，你好像没什么精神啊？\n难道说，脚还在痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "70e2762542ab3761043b8c864b324b95788ef4ae8b5d83a1f975a81ec4198e52", "ja": "ううん、もう全然痛くないよ！　私は元気！\n元気なんだけど……。", "zh": "没有，已经完全不痛了啦！我很有精神的！\n虽然是很有精神啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "c5b4deac1e1a8602cc957582a1cf5a7e4310e341457f71d53eb057a7f50abf55", "ja": "ケガで{$P$}やみんなに、すっごく\n心配かけちゃったから。大人しくしてようかなって。", "zh": "因为受伤，让{$P$}和大家特别担心……所以我想着，还是老实一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1007_p", "source_sha256": "533c6ba7f25ff389a5b73e5b3797edbbd61ec1328602557f0314866a5c45cfca", "ja": "はは、そうだったのか。でもそれならむしろ、\nいつもどおりの、元気な海美でいてほしいかな？", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样。不过既然如此，我反而希望你能像平时一样，做个充满活力的海美，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e240108c181768175a6d2bfad7673758cb1821633a487e3933af5ec621fc4be1", "ja": "その方が、俺もみんなも安心だからな！", "zh": "那样的话，我和大家也会更放心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "e653201fcef20a33c2587b2e3c62ee1e9062ba16034a6265e2485ebdd4765fbe", "ja": "{$P$}……うんっ！\nわかった！　私、元気にする！", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯！\n知道了！我会让你打起精神来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "20ccc8903fe8e714fb1c3fb806e65c658de22730d79aa531fa4e0f214a0bb54b", "ja": "なんかね、4日も大人しくしてたら、\nどんどんテンション下がってきちゃったんだ。", "zh": "总觉得啊，安安静静待了4天，情绪越来越低落了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "d8c6031bbc1ac78343b7f9eacd56622de288cdb721912f97f4f2ad2a3fb96982", "ja": "私、体動かしてないと、心も体もさびついちゃう\nみたい……。だから、早くレッスンしたい！", "zh": "我好像只要不动起来，心情和身体都会生锈似的……。所以，我想快点去练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1012_p", "source_sha256": "95ebe211d8b348189a9767a3146bc1993573a41c9a80f8e762fe8b2fc5e17e08", "ja": "そういう事ならレッスンするべきだな。\n俺も付き合おうか？", "zh": "既然这样，那就该去训练了。我也陪你一起去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "cc324cf4e55fd7ea9ed57fa3e6d140203f2efc4e30ab6d7f4970e2604f321a13", "ja": "ううん、みんなと一緒だから大丈夫！\nそれじゃ、行ってくるね！", "zh": "不，我们和大家一起，所以没问题！\n那我先走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1014_null", "source_sha256": "7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2", "ja": "1時間後……", "zh": "一个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "a3da2a4e602f1b7b940987a5cf373001c32e08dd247d99f72877a98d727c328a", "ja": "{$P$}ーーーーーー！！！\nたっっっだいまあああああっ！！！", "zh": "{$P$}——————！！！\n我回——来——啦————！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1016_p", "source_sha256": "332970c151151fceafe29617a8460c1e9621e39e6fe85f5691444b500c0cc1e6", "ja": "うわ！？　ビックリした……。けど海美、\nすっかりテンションを取り戻したみたいだな！", "zh": "哇！？吓我一跳……。不过海美，\n看来你完全恢复活力了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "7ce38455e6a3c2366b21787503eedd2eabfeab49707546bb8d5fe271aaf623c3", "ja": "うんっ！　思いっきり体動かしたらね、\nモヤモヤしてたのがパーって消えちゃって！", "zh": "嗯！尽情活动了一下身体，闷闷不乐的感觉一下子就消失了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "9f6d5d8adda78d5fbb9558393300fadef0da3a16a183b6ea2d24ef397abff8a3", "ja": "うれしくてうれしくて、私、\nこのままずーっと運動したいーって！", "zh": "我好开心好开心，我都想就这样一直运动下去——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8679eacbe382ea9982187719821b1103cd27aa807722e85d3204d1796b4dcc43", "ja": "あはは、それはなによりだよ。\nでも、くれぐれも無理はしないようにな！", "zh": "哈哈，那真是太好了。\n不过，千万别勉强自己啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "63f7bb7d0f1f174b05631e6a355159a00aba2df13a54edaf04e5e04a35d9b5cc", "ja": "はーい！　それじゃあ、無理しない範囲で、\n劇場の周り走ってくるね！　30周ぐらい！", "zh": "好——！那我就量力而行，去剧场周围跑跑！大概跑30圈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "7c75de83776f0ec9120a2bb65e20daf4b142548b3da427d81a040c0686a793c5", "ja": "体動かせるって、最高♪\nじゃ、いってきまーす！！", "zh": "能活动身体真是太棒啦♪\n那我出发咯——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8a26c7760e562e061111d1471344395f82e5e50730a2b1614c792133f6baf87e", "ja": "え、30周！？　それはいくらなんでも……海美！\n行っちゃったか。", "zh": "诶，30圈！？　这也未免太……海美！\n已经跑掉了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0193_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a25d879e2584c8ce9c4cae40e58baea30c8f9c757c73bb2e6db5994fff67ea5d", "ja": "今まで以上に元気になった気がするけど……\nでもやっぱり、元気で明るい海美が一番だな！", "zh": "感觉比之前更有精神了……\n不过，果然还是充满活力、开朗的海美最好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
